# 🌐 Full Stack Portfolio Website

A modern and responsive Full Stack Portfolio Website designed to showcase my skills, projects, internships, certifications, and achievements as a Frontend Developer and Computer Science student.
This project integrates frontend, backend, and database technologies to provide a complete portfolio solution with a functional contact form that securely stores user messages in MongoDB Atlas.


## 🚀 Live Demo

### 🌍 Frontend (Vercel)

🔗 https://portfolio-fullstack-syns.onrender.com

### ⚙️ Backend API (Render)

🔗 https://portfolio-fullstack-syns.onrender.com

### 📄 GitHub Pages

🔗 https://usershruthi23.github.io/portfolio-fullstack


